# Runtime output. runs/ is deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored: the audit and
# trace files are the demonstrable evidence for the observability and
# explainability criteria, and a reviewer who does not execute the code would
# otherwise have only the docs' word for it. See runs/README.md.
*.log
.cache/

